Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My dear Spider,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,what would you say is the most\Nhuman thing a person can do is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:14.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's when they leave behind a dying message.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:17.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Envisioning the world after their death...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Putting their thoughts into words...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of all creatures, those are skills exclusive to mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's one heck of a skyline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:29.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They don't call Mitario Mouzaia's\Nlargest metropolis for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:32.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spider, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a lucky guy, Purple Ant,\Ngetting to work out of a city this-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell, man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:44.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault for not paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You deserve to die thrice over for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But your monologues are always so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.\NI've got a mission for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Starting next month,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the Tolfa Economic Conference is gonna be running\Nhere in the Westport Building for half a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's got a big, fancy name,\Nbut it's a glorified squabble over rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:09.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The whole continent of Tolfa's been\Na mess since the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the Allies want to figure out\Nhow they're gonna carve up the pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:15.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How revolting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spies from all across the world are gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Fend Commonwealth's CIM will be\Nsending in the entire Retias team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Smart money says the Bumal Kingdom will send in\NShadowseed and the Goosefoot Sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mouzaia's intelligence agency, the JJJ,\Nwill have their cream of the crop there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.21,0:01:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll need to watch out for the Giraffe and the Turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, with how big an event it is, there's no way\Nthat mysterious spy Ouka doesn't show up as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're talking an international all-star roster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your job is to kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a little grisly, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, all of them\Nwould have gotten in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there's one other guy who'll probably come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:02:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The rising star from the Din Republic's\NForeign Intelligence Office:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.13,0:02:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here in Mitario, I reign as king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To think that it's already been\Na month since that conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, how the time flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.25,0:02:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can I offer you a drink, my fair lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.17,0:02:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a spy from the Din Republic, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I must say, I was expecting you to be older.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Might I ask for your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll guess it before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:36.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Until then, let's chat, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:39.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can share the tale of how you\Nand yours took me on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and were met with brutal defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:59.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Me wo aketa kikkake wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.29,0:03:04.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Kokoro saku joukei
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:07.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Hirari hirari yubi no sukima kara
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:09.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Mietekuru shinjitsu wo nirame
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:14.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Kizukareta no wa, rakuen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:18.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Massakasama ochite
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:22.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Aa tatoe kouya demo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:29.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Hitori de ikiru to oritachimashou
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:31.00,Song,,0,0,0,,Ikanakucha
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:34.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Koko ni aru hana wa ima eien nare to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:41.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Gokujou no chihedo wo haite watashi ga ueta mono
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:46.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Kono koe de ashi de te de watashi no mama mogaku hodo ni
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:52.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Doushiyou mo nai sekai ga itoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:59.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Tadoritsuku wa kanarazu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:05.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Musekaeru hodo no yume
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This mission is going to involve\Ninfiltrating a foreign country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.58,0:04:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Serpent is hiding in the United States of Mouzaia,\Nover in the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a major trial for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea, you're going to be in charge of\Ncommand and control at the mission site.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete will be in charge of planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep the situation in mind\Nand give effective orders to the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about you, Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've grown enough to help lighten my load.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.79,0:04:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That'll allow me to operate more freely and\Nfrom a position that makes better use of my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.71,0:04:49.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be standing on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:01.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Cabinet Office Economic Research Center?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is one of the buildings\Nthe Foreign Intelligence Office uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Simply put, this is a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's where the Foreign Intelligence Office houses\Nthe majority of the spies it captures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Bonfire.\NJust the guy I was hoping to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:43.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If they sent in another weakling,\NI might've just killed them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Corpse...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or, I guess they call you Deepwater\Nover in the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roland is fine.\NIt's what I'm used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bonfire, how about we have us\Na fight to the death, one-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You won't catch me by surprise this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to play around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I guess I'll have to take that girl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:18.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your only job is to cough up intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Empire's elite team Serpent has infiltrated\Nthe United States' city of Mitario
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and is interfering with the Tolfa Economic Conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do I have that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was helping Purple Ant out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:34.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Purple Ant...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the Serpent member they have there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where is he, exactly?\NWhat does he look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here, and I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you try to go in blind,\NPurple Ant will slaughter you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just like last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you'll lose those precious teammates of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spare me the empty threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.17,0:07:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should kick the dark-haired kid off your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back when we fought, she was useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:09.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All she did was shake in her boots and flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'd be better off cutting her loose\Nbefore she drags you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, I actually had something\NI wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did you think that you and I could be rivals?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're just a two-bit nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:32.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your life as a spy is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:41.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to be the one giving\Nthe orders during this mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I thought it would be good for you\Nto see where our intel was coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everything Roland said was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I did back then was tremble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:55.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And on top of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea, honey, you're a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:08:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're soft, and it made manipulating you\Nso incredibly effortless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach, I-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.25,0:08:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that last right the turn to get to the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The car just started acting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:25.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't make it drop below sixty kilometers an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is no standard malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Has anything odd happened to you lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was this bearded man who told me\Nthat he knew what I'd done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I stole some money from the safe at my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He told me that if I wanted him to keep quiet,\Nthat I had to give you two a ride in my taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You sort of brought this on yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we should at least compensate you\Nfor getting you involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once this is over, call this number.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.83,0:09:05.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, close your eyes and cover your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've gotten good at masking your presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I take it this is your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, I've been found!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a message for you from Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you want the taxi to stop, just admit that you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:31.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've got a big mission coming up,\Nso we're coming at you with everything we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to get a taste of how much\Nwe've grown on our domestic missions!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And on that note, I'm out, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.33,0:09:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But, Annette, what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:42.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a hostage, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Try to slow Klaus down for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And a hip, hop, and away we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.38,0:09:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,T-Teach, you have to stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can do it, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could, but this is Annette we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:10:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She probably has the taxi rigged\Nto explode as soon as it stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to get off this wild ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For now, we need to get out of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll stop the car somewhere out of\Ntheir homing device's reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The question is, why only sixty kilometers an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this speed, I can still turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Surely they could have set it a bit faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,E-easy enough for you to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The homing device never mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They have Aiden tracking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And sixty kilometers an hour is slow enough\Nfor a pigeon to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No remorse about friendly fire, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I figured I didn't stand\Nmuch of a chance against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But hey, guess what I just nicked?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go show him why you're our ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.38,0:11:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too slow by half.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't beat him, even with\Nthree people attacking in waves?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've got four.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're wide open, Klaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:50.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,W-we did it?\NWe finally beat Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.75,0:12:04.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The first Monika who showed up\Nwas Grete in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:05.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even you would have no choice\Nbut to give Monika your full attention, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had hoped that might leave you vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, Klaus.\NLet's hear that surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've grown so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.33,0:12:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew you all had boundless talents\Njust waiting to be set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:33.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As I recall, you're still only on\Nyour provisional academy graduations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You each still have plenty of problem areas,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the explosive power you've shown working\Ntogether as a team is on par with that of full graduates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll call this next mission your graduation exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,On par with full graduates?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:50.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I never thought I would hear him say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, and also,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,how much longer should I keep\Nplaying along with this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I told the driver what'd happen\Nif she told a soul, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That woman was so loose-lipped,\NI was able to blackmail her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I told her that I would help cover up her embezzlement\Nas long as she called the cops for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That note...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I would get out while the getting is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do you think the police are going to feel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,about the way you're holding a fine,\Nupstanding citizen at gunpoint?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,L-let's book it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.13,0:13:29.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quit dawdlin', let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, how many people have we got\Nriding in this damn thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aww, what a bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:42.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And we were so close, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, we might have actually won\Nif we'd included Thea in the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you'd been in charge of getting\Nthe driver on our side,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the negotiation probably\Nwould have gone a lot cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leaving me in the dark was the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I'd known what was going to happen,\NTeach would have seen right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really? I dunno about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:09.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's true.\NThey didn't need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, I'm pretty excited\Nabout visiting the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we'll get a chance to go sightseeing\Nafter the mission's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanna check out one of those baseball games\Nthey keep talkin' about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:21.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to watch a TV broadcast, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna buy up every appliance I find!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I might go check out some museums and galleries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:29.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to go see the big famous goddess statue!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to buy a bunch of records as souvenirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:34.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love jazz.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would love to visit a music hall with the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about you, Thea?\NWhat're you looking forward to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me? I-I haven't given it much thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.21,0:14:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,United States, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we'll be fine with me in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm too kind to my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not fit to lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:11.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really think that you should be\Nthe one giving the orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.13,0:15:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's too much we don't know about our opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.13,0:15:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With how little intel we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need to be the one standing on the front lines\Nand shouldering that danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There it is! Mouzaia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.75,0:15:32.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that really Mitario?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a gigantic city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be so down on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, differences between allies\Nare the key to a strong team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There times when what the team\Nneeds is ruthlessness,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but there are times when that kindness\Nof yours is what it needs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.67,0:15:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.71,0:15:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right now, the United States of Mouzaia\Nsits at the heart of the world economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Instead of participating in the Great War directly,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they merely supplied weapons and food to the Allies,\Nallowing them to flourish unimpeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The economic conference isn't the\Nonly thing going on in Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Between the B2B meetings,\Npolitical fundraising parties,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and military discussions held behind closed doors,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.25,0:16:41.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there are over a thousand gatherings\Nof various sizes taking place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.63,0:16:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder the conference\Ntakes place over such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:53.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That jazz band often gets hired to play\Nat politicians' parties and social gatherings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:57.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect infiltration point for gathering intel from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's a natural pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Minister!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Minster, what are your thoughts heading into\Nthis meeting with the Lylat Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have questions about the way you've been\Nappeasing the Galgad Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least answer our damn questions, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-why, I never!\NWhat nation do you report for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm with the Din Republic's Randium Times.\NWhat about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:22.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, you're in the way.\NMove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:25.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla is using her position as a newspaper journalist
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to interact with politicians and bureaucrats\Nfrom around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dang, he gave me the slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.13,0:17:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I nicked the minister's business card case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hope it's useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's as skillful as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's your cheeseburger combo meals!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, not to be a bother, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's up?\NDid you have a question for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:17:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That is to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a question for the exchange student attending\Nthe Mitario University School of Pharmacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A question for Lillian Hepburn, the eighteen-year-old\Nwho got this job to pay her way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me the trouble\Nof explaining your backstory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lillian, take this up to\NConference Room 13 on the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The primary Tolfa Economic Conference meetings\Nare taking place on the upper floors of this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like she's doing a good job blending in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:33.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are fish burgers, not cheeseburgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just hope she doesn't end up getting fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Toodles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Finally, we have the Specialist squad trio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.54,0:18:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Question 100...\NThis is last one, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Westport Building is forty-eight stories tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On the eighth floor, there's a rooftop garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please list every point you could snipe a target\Nsitting on the garden's north-side bench from.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's five of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:18:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lyment Hall...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nywengate Tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The construction site next door would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And with a top-of-the-line sniper rifle,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you could make the shot from Mitario Hotel\Nor the art hall's control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work!\NYou got the correct-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I found another one, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:20.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a circus staying at\NWest Kopek Plaza next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You could hit the target from on top of the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be tall enough to reach the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if the target was on the north bench,\Nyou could still hit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind of sniper goes and\Nclimbs on top of a circus tent?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.29,0:19:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can't let ourselves get bogged down\Nby common sense, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yeep?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're both right, and you both get full points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We brought you something, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:53.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were watching that,\NMiss Thea and Miss Grete?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The two of them are so talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The questions were pretty hard,\Nand they got them all correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To be honest, they're both\Na lot better at all this than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything, the way you're able to rein them in\Nis the most impressive skill of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's review the full situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:14.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are all the other nations' spies up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:20.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss already got ahold of some intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, spies are being\Nsnuffed out one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll need to keep in close touch with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That way, we'll be able to quickly\Ndispatch backup if they get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even so, though, there's only\Nso much we'll be able to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll have to trust in their ability to\Nhandle things on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.58,0:20:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,G-good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:43.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should pass along that intel\Nand tell them to be on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can go ahead and leave that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:47.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:48.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll get on that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:54.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one in a slump.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.21,0:20:57.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is firing on all cylinders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:01.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They're all motivated, and none of them\Nhave their hearts plagued by doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:04.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm being left behind all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.17,0:21:08.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What kind of spy am I trying to become?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:11.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to be just any old spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to become a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spies can only save their own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But heroes, heroes can save so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:24.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The way I am now,\NI can't even save my own teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.29,0:21:28.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They could end up dead, and it would all be my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I finished making breakfast, Thea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.67,0:21:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, we're bringing it all the way over?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.79,0:21:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry for asking you to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Four plates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I felt I didn't have much choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to go out of your way like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow, I'll handle the cooking myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.13,0:21:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, something smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it time for breakfast?\NPerfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.38,0:22:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm famished.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:31.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Aa, kataashi de tatte tsurai okimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.25,0:22:37.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Mou kyouyuu shite chanto yottemasuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.71,0:22:43.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Ai o motte chigau nanika abiserare
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.25,0:22:48.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Yakkaisou de jama na watashi, waita waita
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.04,0:22:51.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Honto daijoubu?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.67,0:22:54.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Sore kiite dou suru no?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:59.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Tada homeru dake de ii
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.83,0:23:03.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Iienai ienai kagami no sei
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:06.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Mirenai kienai yogoreta sei
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:11.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Assari kamikitte sameta me de uso o minuku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.71,0:23:14.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Katenai kaenai na muku na hin
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:17.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Suteru mono nai mukurodashi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:23.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Kakugo wa kakusazu hada de te ni motte aragau
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:25.58,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.58,0:23:28.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Rakugaki darake no aimai na unmei
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.79,0:23:31.08,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:34.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Kami de sae keisotsu ni damashiteku
